478 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 427 0 R/T(You learn quickly that almost every show starts there and ends there. The gear has to come off safely, get where it needs to go, and at the end of the night somehow make its way back onto the truck in a way that still makes sense.)/E(You learn quickly that almost every show starts there and ends there. The gear has to come off safely, get where it needs to go, and at the end of the night somehow make its way back onto the truck in a way that still makes sense.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

479 0 obj
