endobj

480 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 427 0 R/T(The goal is simple: help you build safer packs, work faster with your crew, and show up better prepared for load-ins and load-outs. Not by overcomplicating it, but by teaching the logic behind the pack in a way that makes sense when you finally see it in the real world.)/E(The goal is simple: help you build safer packs, work faster with your crew, and show up better prepared for load-ins and load-outs. Not by overcomplicating it, but by teaching the logic behind the pack in a way that makes sense when you finally see it in the real world.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

481 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 427 0 R/T(Our team has put countless hours into turning Truck Packology into a practical and reliable training resource for the AV community. The more people understand how a truck is packed, why things go where they go, and how the crew works together, the smoother and safer the entire process becomes.)/E(Our team has put countless hours into turning Truck Packology into a practical and reliable training resource for the AV community. The more people understand how a truck is packed, why things go where they go, and how the crew works together, the smoother and safer the entire process becomes.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[6]>>
